  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Teacher’s Correction Key",
    "overview": "Pine ink anchors a warm paper workspace. White work areas hold the active task; quiet green notes and narrow evidence sections keep explanations close to the material they explain. Density comes from ordinary reading and form controls, with no decorative imagery competing with a question.\n\nThis is an operational interface: a modest system sans hierarchy, clear labels, restrained color states, and flat bordered surfaces. The recurring visual signature is an answer or question paired with a source excerpt beneath a fine divider.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Pine masthead and actions over a warm paper ground.",
      "White task areas, fine rules, and compact softly rounded controls.",
      "Adjacent explanations, source excerpts, and answer history.",
      "Text-labelled green, amber, and terracotta states."
    ],
    "rules": [
